@startuml
!include ./nora-medlink-style.puml
title Figure 3.11 — Nora MedLink Activity Diagram: Appointment Booking

start
:Patient opens appointment module;
:System loads registered and demo doctors;
:Patient filters doctor list;
:Patient selects doctor and appointment date;
if (Date is current or future?) then (Yes)
  :Backend authenticates patient;
  :Resolve registered doctor if available;
  :Create Appointment with BOOKED status;
  :Set payment status to PENDING;
  if (Patient submitted access OTP?) then (Yes)
    :Validate unused, unexpired OTP;
    if (OTP valid and doctor registered?) then (Yes)
      :Grant temporary patient dashboard access;
    else (No)
      :Continue appointment without access grant;
    endif
  else (No)
    :Skip access grant;
  endif
  :Commit appointment transaction;
  :Return booking confirmation;
else (No)
  :Reject appointment date;
  :Return validation error;
endif
stop
@enduml
